// Problem (#use-cases) · eyebrow "Why it's hard" (§8).
// Per the Figma redesign (node 4157-28712): the calm statement sits at the top,
// and below it sit FOUR lived-symptom cards — each an icon + line of text —
// fanned into an overlapping stack (hand-of-cards), tilted and vertically
// staggered. They fade + rise in together on scroll.
//
// Each card carries a tilt (--rot) and a vertical offset (--dy) for the arc.
